<p>Old Persian <a href="/wiki/Wiktionary:Lemmas" title="Wiktionary:Lemmas">lemmas</a>, categorized by their part of speech.
</p>
<ul><li><a href="/wiki/Category:Old_Persian_adjectives" title="Category:Old Persian adjectives">Category:Old Persian adjectives</a>: Old Persian terms that give attributes to nouns, extending their definitions.</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Category:Old_Persian_adverbs" title="Category:Old Persian adverbs">Category:Old Persian adverbs</a>: Old Persian terms that modify clauses, sentences and phrases directly.</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Category:Old_Persian_conjunctions" title="Category:Old Persian conjunctions">Category:Old Persian conjunctions</a>: Old Persian terms that connect words, phrases or clauses together.</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Category:Old_Persian_determiners" title="Category:Old Persian determiners">Category:Old Persian determiners</a>: Old Persian terms that narrow down, within the conversational context, the referent of the following noun.</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Category:Old_Persian_morphemes" title="Category:Old Persian morphemes">Category:Old Persian morphemes</a>: Old Persian word-elements used to form full words.</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Category:Old_Persian_multiword_terms" title="Category:Old Persian multiword terms">Category:Old Persian multiword terms</a>: Old Persian lemmas that are a combination of multiple words, including <a href="/wiki/Wiktionary:CFI#Idiomaticity" class="mw-redirect" title="Wiktionary:CFI">idiomatic</a> combinations.</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Category:Old_Persian_nouns" title="Category:Old Persian nouns">Category:Old Persian nouns</a>: Old Persian terms that indicate people, beings, things, places, phenomena, qualities or ideas.</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Category:Old_Persian_numerals" title="Category:Old Persian numerals">Category:Old Persian numerals</a>: Old Persian terms that quantify nouns.</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Category:Old_Persian_particles" title="Category:Old Persian particles">Category:Old Persian particles</a>: Old Persian terms that do not belong to any of the inflected grammatical word classes, often lacking their own grammatical functions and forming other parts of speech or expressing the relationship between clauses.</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Category:Old_Persian_prepositions" title="Category:Old Persian prepositions">Category:Old Persian prepositions</a>: Old Persian adpositions that are placed before their objects.</li>
